---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="Lean privacy policy for HomeBillCuts — content site, affiliate links, and optional email."
  canonicalPath="/privacy/"
>
  <article class="prose">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p><em>Last updated: September 7, 2026</em></p>
    <p>
      HomeBillCuts (“we,” “us”) operates homebillcuts.com. This policy describes how we handle
      information on this static content site. It is written in plain language and is not legal advice.
    </p>

    <h2>Information we collect</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>
        <strong>Server / hosting logs:</strong> Our host (for example Cloudflare Pages) may
        automatically collect standard request data such as IP address, user agent, and pages visited
        for security and reliability.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Email (optional):</strong> If you subscribe when our email form is enabled, we will
        store the address you provide and any preferences you set. You can unsubscribe at any time.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Contact email:</strong> If you email us, we receive whatever you include in the message.
      </li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Cookies and analytics</h2>
    <p>
      This site is designed to work without invasive tracking. We may add privacy-respecting analytics
      later. If we do, we will update this page. We do not invent or embed analytics IDs in this repo.
    </p>

    <h2>Affiliate links</h2>
    <p>
      Some product links may be affiliate links. If you click and purchase, we may earn a commission
      at no extra cost to you. Affiliate partners may set cookies or receive referral information so
      they can credit a purchase. See our <a href="/disclosure/">Disclosure</a> page.
    </p>

    <h2>How we use information</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Operate and secure the website</li>
      <li>Respond to messages you send</li>
      <li>Send email newsletters you opt into (when enabled)</li>
      <li>Understand aggregate traffic patterns if analytics are added later</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Sharing</h2>
    <p>
      We do not sell personal information. We may share data with service providers who help us run
      the site (hosting, email delivery) under their own privacy terms, or when required by law.
    </p>

    <h2>Children</h2>
    <p>This site is not directed at children under 13, and we do not knowingly collect their data.</p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>
      Privacy questions: <strong>hello@homebillcuts.com</strong>
      (placeholder — update when your inbox is live).
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
